cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Stepper-C in your work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Stepper-C"
abstract: >-
  Closed-loop microstepping current control for two-phase hybrid stepper motors in
  portable C11 for embedded systems: PI current control with back-EMF feed-forward,
  trapezoidal motion planning, two power stage topologies and fixed-point or float
  arithmetic, with no heap, no RTOS and MISRA C:2012 compliance.
authors:
